{
  "_about": [
    "Usage blocks per provider format, for the usage-detail tests. 'recorded' means the block is copied from a",
    "live answer committed in docs/provider-verification/ (the file and provider are named). 'documented' means",
    "the shape is the provider's published API format with illustrative numbers: no live answer from that",
    "provider is in this repository, and tests never call the network. The stream form of a recorded block",
    "puts the same block in the final frame, the way OpenAI-style providers deliver it with include_usage.",
    "expect.input/output are null for the providers' own (non-OpenAI) formats: the chat path reads input and",
    "output from prompt_tokens/completion_tokens only, and these tests are about the extra kinds."
